<h1>Format (Label)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">T</span><span lang="EN-US">he</span> <span lang="EN-US" class="Command">Format (Label)</span> <span lang="EN-US">command is accessible from the</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>context menu for labels</b></span> <b><i style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;"><span class="Path">&gt;</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Format</b></span></i></b><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">This command formats individual label. When you call it the following dialog appears:</span></p>
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../Measure/images/format_label.gif" width="411px" height="339px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB">Fields X Y Z</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">Check these options to display individual X, Y, and Z components for the fields &#160;related to co-ordinates, normals, and axes</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Fields area</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Check these options to display the available fields for the corresponding entity. For information about the fields see the table in <a href="labeling.htm#Label_fields">Labeling</a> command.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Preview</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Displays the label preview according to the current settings.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Name only</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Check this option to display the name of the entity only. No fields will be included. If this option is checked for labels for points from compound entities, then no information will be displayed in the label.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Vertical</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Check this option to display XYZ components vertically.</p>
<p class="Example" style="font-size:10.0pt; font-family:Arial; text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-US"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP222161803" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Measure/images/labels_vertical.gif" width="268px" height="218px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p>Left label with <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Vertical</b></span> option on; right label with <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Vertical</b></span> option off</p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle">Set as default for this type</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Sets the current options as default for this entity type. It will affect the further labels.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Apply to all</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Applies the current options for all existing labels for entities from this type.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">General button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Press this button to call</span> <span style="font-style:italic;"><i><a href="Preferences_-_Display_-_Labels.htm">Preferences &gt; Display &gt; Labels</a></i></span> <span style="font-weight:normal;">dialog, from where the settings can be changed globally, i.e. for all label types.</span></p>
<p class="whs6"><b><i style="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="javascript:void(0);" onclick="var e; if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion)&gt;=4){e=event;} if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) &gt;=2 &amp;&amp; typeof(PopupMenu_Invoke) == 'function') PopupMenu_Invoke(e,'','Labeling','labeling.htm','Measure Context Menus','../User_Interface/Measure_Context_Menus.htm');return false;" title=""><img src="../add_on/ss_btn_see_also.gif" border="0" height="17" width="60" alt=""></a></span></i></b></p>
